\subsection{Uncertainty and stratified diagnostics}

Entity-bootstrap confidence intervals are shown in
Table~\ref{tab:bootstrap-ci}. The intervals reinforce the main benchmark story:
\method{} is clearly separated from NaiveAnchor on P12 and USHCN, competitive
with the best anchor-family member on MIMIC and HumanActivity, and close to APN
on the two strongest neural-model datasets. We additionally log history density,
last gap, median gap, volatility, and mode fraction per prediction; the resulting
stratified tables are used to diagnose which regimes are dominated by local
stability versus sparse or phase-like history structure.

